    "lang": "en",
    "stem": "You want to estimate the test effort for the new project using estimation based on ratios. You  calculate the test-to-development effort ratio using averaged data for both development effort and  test effort from four historical projects similar to the new one. The table shows this historical data.  Project  Development effort   ($)  Test effort   ($)  P1  800,000  40,000  P2  1,200,000  130,000  P3  600,000  70,000  P4  1,000,000  120,000  The estimated development effort for the new project is $800,000. What is your estimate of the test  effort in this project?",
